WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.350
Indigenous Veterans.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.162
Served the Crown, betrayed by it.

00:00:05.162 --> 00:00:13.712
Indigenous soldiers fought in both World Wars and Korea, then returned home to have their treaty rights stripped and their veteran benefits denied.
